  "title": "The Truth About Thinking",
  "content_type": "paragraph",
  "content_text": "The Truth About Thinking\n[思考的真相]\nToday I tried to summarize some ideas from Li Xiaolai’s book The Truth About Thinking.\n[今天我尝试复述下李笑来的书《思考的真相》里的内容；]\nFirst, it introduces some fundamental thinking concepts: definition, classification, comparison, causality, and decision-making.\n[首先是关于思考的一些基本概念，主要包括有定义、分类、比较、因果、决策。]\nA definition is an unambiguous description of an essential concept.\n[定义就是将必要的概念做无歧义的描述；]\nClassification is about grouping concepts or things by the same category or attribute to make comparisons.\n[然后分类就是将这些概念/事物放在同一范畴同一属性下比较。]\nCausality refers to analyzing the relationship between A and B.\n[因果就是分析A、B 之间的关系；]\nThis can be linked to second-order thinking models. In daily life, we can analyze causality by asking:\n[这里可以联系到第二序思维模型，即日常生活中可以进一步思考这样分析因果：]\n1. Is A the cause of B?\n[1. A 是 B的原因吗？]\n2. If A is the cause of B, is it the only cause?\n[2. 如果A是B的原因，那么，A是B的唯一原因吗?]\n3. If A isn’t the only cause, what are the other causes?\n[3. 如果A不是B的唯一原因，那么还有哪些原因?]\n4. If A isn’t the most important cause, what is?\n[4. 如果A不是B的最重要原因，那么最重要的原因到底是什么?]\nDecision-making comes from combining and analyzing the above methods.\n[决策就是通过上面的方法组合分析得出自己的决策。]\nMore advanced ideas include analogy and the concept of an operating system.\n[更进阶一些的概念有：类比、操作系统。]\nThe “operating system” refers to our brain, which contains a concept list, a relationship list, and a process list.\n[操作系统就是我们的大脑，系统里包含概念表、关系表、流程表。]\nThe concept list corresponds to cognition, the relationship list to judgment, and the process list to action.\n[其中概念表对应的是认知、关系表对应着判断，流程表对应着行动。]\nIf we have enough essential and clear concepts and understand their relationships, we can make judgments and act accordingly.\n[有足够多必要清晰的概念，然后弄清楚它们之间的关系，就能做出判断，按既定的流程去行动。]\nThat’s a brief recap of The Truth About Thinking.\n[以上就是关于思考的真相的一些简单的复述。]",
