          "language": "en"
        },
        {
          "text": "今天我尝试复述下李笑来的书《思考的真相》里的内容；",
          "start_time": 2.304,
          "end_time": 7.895999999999999,
          "language": "source"
        },
        {
          "text": "\n",
          "start_time": 94.36800000000001,
          "end_time": 94.36800000000001,
          "language": "en"
        },
        {
          "text": "First, it introduces some fundamental thinking concepts: definition, classification, comparison, causality, and decision-making.",
          "start_time": 7.895999999999999,
          "end_time": 17.375999999999998,
          "language": "en"
        },
        {
          "text": "\n",
          "start_time": 94.36800000000001,
          "end_time": 94.36800000000001,
          "language": "en"
        },
        {
          "text": "首先是关于思考的一些基本概念，主要包括有定义、分类、比较、因果、决策。",
          "start_time": 7.895999999999999,
          "end_time": 17.375999999999998,
          "language": "source"
        },
        {
          "text": "\n",
          "start_time": 94.36800000000001,
          "end_time": 94.36800000000001,
          "language": "en"
        },
        {
          "text": "A definition is an unambiguous description of an essential concept.",
          "start_time": 17.375999999999998,
          "end_time": 22.223999999999997,
          "language": "en"
        },
        {
          "text": "\n",
          "start_time": 94.36800000000001,
          "end_time": 94.36800000000001,
          "language": "en"
        },
        {
          "text": "定义就是将必要的概念做无歧义的描述；",
          "start_time": 17.375999999999998,
          "end_time": 22.223999999999997,
          "language": "source"
        },
        {
          "text": "\n",
          "start_time": 94.36800000000001,
          "end_time": 94.36800000000001,
          "language": "en"
        },
        {
          "text": "Classification is about grouping concepts or things by the same category or attribute to make comparisons.",
          "start_time": 22.223999999999997,
          "end_time": 29.208,
          "language": "en"
        },
        {
          "text": "\n",
          "start_time": 94.36800000000001,
          "end_time": 94.36800000000001,
          "language": "en"
        },
        {
          "text": "然后分类就是将这些概念/事物放在同一范畴同一属性下比较。",
          "start_time": 22.223999999999997,
          "end_time": 29.208,
          "language": "source"
        },
        {
          "text": "\n",
          "start_time": 94.36800000000001,
          "end_time": 94.36800000000001,
          "language": "en"
        },
        {
          "text": "Causality refers to analyzing the relationship between A and B.",
          "start_time": 29.208,
          "end_time": 33.96,
          "language": "en"
        },
        {
          "text": "\n",
          "start_time": 94.36800000000001,
          "end_time": 94.36800000000001,
          "language": "en"
        },
        {
          "text": "因果就是分析A、B 之间的关系；",
          "start_time": 29.208,
          "end_time": 33.96,
          "language": "source"
        },
        {
          "text": "\n",
          "start_time": 94.36800000000001,
          "end_time": 94.36800000000001,
          "language": "en"
        },
        {
          "text": "This can be linked to second-order thinking models. In daily life, we can analyze causality by asking:",
          "start_time": 33.96,
          "end_time": 41.688,
          "language": "en"
        },
        {
          "text": "\n",
          "start_time": 94.36800000000001,
          "end_time": 94.36800000000001,
          "language": "en"
        },
        {
          "text": "这里可以联系到第二序思维模型，即日常生活中可以进一步思考这样分析因果：",
          "start_time": 33.96,
          "end_time": 41.688,
          "language": "source"
        },
        {
          "text": "\n",
          "start_time": 94.36800000000001,
          "end_time": 94.36800000000001,
          "language": "en"
        },
        {
          "text": "1. Is A the cause of B?",
          "start_time": 41.688,
          "end_time": 44.496,
          "language": "en"
        },
        {
          "text": "\n",
          "start_time": 94.36800000000001,
          "end_time": 94.36800000000001,
          "language": "en"
        },
        {
          "text": "1. A 是 B的原因吗？",
