          "language": "en"
        },
        {
          "text": "决策就是通过上面的方法组合分析得出自己的决策。",
          "start_time": 58.128,
          "end_time": 62.856,
          "language": "source"
        },
        {
          "text": "\n",
          "start_time": 94.36800000000001,
          "end_time": 94.36800000000001,
          "language": "en"
        },
        {
          "text": "More advanced ideas include analogy and the concept of an operating system.",
          "start_time": 62.856,
          "end_time": 68.136,
          "language": "en"
        },
        {
          "text": "\n",
          "start_time": 94.36800000000001,
          "end_time": 94.36800000000001,
          "language": "en"
        },
        {
          "text": "更进阶一些的概念有：类比、操作系统。",
          "start_time": 62.856,
          "end_time": 68.136,
          "language": "source"
        },
        {
          "text": "\n",
          "start_time": 94.36800000000001,
          "end_time": 94.36800000000001,
          "language": "en"
        },
        {
          "text": "The “operating system” refers to our brain, which contains a concept list, a relationship list, and a process list.",
          "start_time": 68.136,
          "end_time": 76.392,
          "language": "en"
        },
        {
          "text": "\n",
          "start_time": 94.36800000000001,
          "end_time": 94.36800000000001,
          "language": "en"
        },
        {
          "text": "操作系统就是我们的大脑，系统里包含概念表、关系表、流程表。",
          "start_time": 68.136,
          "end_time": 76.392,
          "language": "source"
        },
        {
          "text": "\n",
          "start_time": 94.36800000000001,
          "end_time": 94.36800000000001,
          "language": "en"
        },
        {
          "text": "The concept list corresponds to cognition, the relationship list to judgment, and the process list to action.",
          "start_time": 76.392,
          "end_time": 83.568,
          "language": "en"
        },
        {
          "text": "\n",
          "start_time": 94.36800000000001,
          "end_time": 94.36800000000001,
          "language": "en"
        },
        {
          "text": "其中概念表对应的是认知、关系表对应着判断，流程表对应着行动。",
          "start_time": 76.392,
          "end_time": 83.568,
          "language": "source"
        },
        {
          "text": "\n",
          "start_time": 94.36800000000001,
          "end_time": 94.36800000000001,
          "language": "en"
        },
        {
          "text": "If we have enough essential and clear concepts and understand their relationships, we can make judgments and act accordingly.",
          "start_time": 83.568,
          "end_time": 90.888,
          "language": "en"
        },
        {
          "text": "\n",
          "start_time": 94.36800000000001,
          "end_time": 94.36800000000001,
          "language": "en"
        },
        {
          "text": "有足够多必要清晰的概念，然后弄清楚它们之间的关系，就能做出判断，按既定的流程去行动。",
          "start_time": 83.568,
          "end_time": 90.888,
          "language": "source"
        },
        {
          "text": "\n",
          "start_time": 94.36800000000001,
          "end_time": 94.36800000000001,
          "language": "en"
        },
        {
          "text": "That’s a brief recap of The Truth About Thinking.",
